______
Title:
Switching off - The Haunted Hotel

________
Concept:
Turn the power off to escape from the haunted hotel.

_________
Paradigm:
You gotta make your way to find the exit out of this hotel without getting caught.

_________
Features:
>> Hidding
>> Obstacles
>> Sabotage

__________
Mechanics:
>> Hidding
	Hide under beds and cabinets to avoid getting caught, when they enter a room you're in.
>> Sabotage
	Turning the lights off will make your way out of the situation easier, gaining the advantage over enemies, also makes you invisible to their sights but not to their "touch" (you can touch them and still get caught).
	They might eventually going to fix to be able to see.
	It might be eventually more than just "lights" but for now take lights off as sabotage.
>> Obstacles
	Sometimes the environment won't be on your side so you will need to make your way out by "puzzling" things, maybe sabotaging stuff to get some enemy attention or by blocking their way in some way.
	It might as well be a safety tool to avoid getting easily caught when chased.

